{"type":"assistant/message","seq":25,"time":1792545522306,"data":{"turn":1,"step":2,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"The user wants me to organize/articulate the problem they'll be working on: the alignment problem in the clarification stage. Let me re-read their message carefully.\n\n\"我们这个工作流程, 现在要致力于解决一个问题,就是澄清环节的对齐. AI抛出一个问题,人类可能根本看不懂,计算看懂了可能也不知道最终产出的结果是什么效果. 我们允许一个任务完成后打补丁, 但是任务完成后差距太大或者由于前期的设计问题导致的架构问题,会导致大量返工,这种场景尽量少出现. 你来整理一下,我们将致力于解决的问题\"\n\nSo the problem: In their skill workflow (cgraphx), the clarification phase has an alignment problem. AI asks a question, human may not understand it at all; even if understood, human may not know what the final output/effect will look like. They allow post-completion patches, but when the gap is too large or early design flaws cause architectural problems, massive rework results — minimize those scenarios.\n\nThey want me to organize the problem statement. This is itself a clarification-type task. Per the skill, I should explore context first (read the clarify-requirements skill — done), maybe recall knowledge, then present a structured understanding and ask for confirmation. The deliverable here is a problem definition they confirm.\n\nI should structure: root cause chain, symptom, cost, goal/non-goal. Let me write it in the skill's style: one-sentence summary, breakdown of the problem layers, and confirm with the user. Keep it focused — this is meta-discussion about improving their skill flow, so the \"business decisions\" are about scoping the problem.\n\nLet me think about the problem structure:\n\n**一句话**: AI 在澄清环节抛出的问题与人的理解/预见能力不匹配,导致人无法有效拍板,错误决策流入后续阶段,任务完成后才发现差距,大量返工。\n\nDecompose into sub-problems:\n1. **问题看不懂** — AI 的问题用了技术黑话/抽象维度,人不理解问题本身 → 无法回答或瞎答\n2. **答案无法预见后果** — 即使看懂了问题,人也想象不出\"这个答案会导致最终产品长什么样\" → 拍板时是盲的\n3. **错误决策的代价后置** — 决策错误在澄清阶段成本为零,到实现完成后才暴露;差距小可打补丁,差距大(尤其架构级)需大量返工\n\nRoot cause: 决策时人脑中缺少两个东西:(a) 问题的可理解表征;(b) 决策→结果的映射(选 A 最终会是什么效果)。\n\nGoal: 让人每次拍板时,能看懂问题、能预见所选答案的