"," B","."," 业务","值"," +"," ","链","的结构"," |"," A"," ","之外","，","还能","改","链条","本身","——“","不要","等待","框","，","改成","后台","任务","+","通知","”"," |"," ","灵","活","，","但","链","结构","往往","牵","动","技术","方案","，","人","改","结构","容易","改","出","不可","行的","稿"," |\n","|"," C","."," 全","开放"," |"," 包括","“","触发","后","端","函数","”","这类","实现","环节","也能","改"," |"," ","边","界","消失","，","人","被","拖","进","实现","细节","，","回到","“","人","要","懂","技术","”","的老","路"," |\n\n","我的","推荐","是"," **","A","**:","链","的结构","(","等待","框","还是","后台","任务","这类",")","属于","方案","范畴","，","应该","由"," AI"," 在","提案","里","给出"," ","2"," 选"," ","1"," 的","**","变","体","**","让人","选","，","而不是","让人","自由","改","。","你","定","哪个？"]},{"type":"chunk","time":1792546297243,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"The user is sharpening their solution: the interaction form. AI's output should be organized by functional point (功能点), e.g., \"export feature: click export button → page shows waiting modal → triggers backend export function → function logic filters by created_time, last 90 days\". Human sees this and makes decisions: adopt, or modify function name, or modify time range, or modify filter conditions.\n\nSo the unit of alignment is a \"功能点\" — a usage chain described at a semi-technical level (UI action → behavior → logic parameters), and the human's decisions are edits to concrete elements of that chain (rename, change 90 to 30, change filter condition). This is different from abstract questions — it's a concrete, reviewable artifact per functional point.\n\nInteresting: this sits between my思路一 (usage perspective) and something more specific — it's like \"executable spec fragments\" presented for review. Human edits parameters rather than answers questions. It's essentially: AI proposes a complete concrete behavior chain, human reviews/edits. That matches思路二 (default-first) but the unit is 功能点 and the form is behavior chain, not question.\n\nI should reflect this back precisely, sharpen the concept, name it, show an example of the interaction form, identify what's locked vs open. Then next single decision question with recommendation.\n\nKey sharpening:\n- Unit: 功能点 (not question, not whole requirement)\n- Form: 完整行为链 = 触发(用户操作) → 前端表现 → 后端动作 → 核心判断逻辑(具体参数值)\n- Decision mode: 人不答题,人改稿 — adopt / edit concrete elements (names, ranges, conditions)\n- Why it works: every decision point appears as a concrete editable value inside a scenario, not an abstract question; human sees the whole chain so consequences are visible (click → waiting box → 90 days data)\n\nOpen questions to clarify (pick one, with recommendation): granularity/coverage — does every functional point include the backend logic level (like function name, SQL condition)? Or only user-visible behavior, with logic details left to plan/spec? There's a tension: showing \"export函数判断逻辑按创建时间近90天\" exposes implementation; but user explicitly wants it — it lets human catch wrong filter conditions. Also: what stage does this happen in — clarify replaces decision-table? And what's the carrier (对话内文本 vs 落盘文件)?\n\nBest next single decision: the boundary of what a 功能点 card contains — 用户可见行为 only vs 包含核心逻辑参数 (user's example includes function name and logic). Actually user's example already includes function name + logic. Maybe ask about the interaction carrier & loop: 单次呈现全部功能点清单 vs 逐个确认? Recommend: 清单式一次呈现, 人逐条采纳/修改(不逐个阻塞式问).\n\nActually more fundamental: this replaces clarify's \"一次只问一个决策\" pattern — the alignment form changes from Q&A to \"提案-改稿\" review loop. Confirm that.\n\nLet me structure: 复述 + 概念命名(功能点卡片/行为链提案) + 示例交互形态 + 它如何打三个断点 + 下一个决策问题."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1792546297243,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"明白了，这就把「呈现形态」具体化了——而且它实际上**改变了交互的范式**，我复述并锐化一下：\n\n## 交互形态：从「问答」改成「功能点提案-改稿」\n\n**一句话**：AI 不再抛抽象问题让人答，而是以**功能点为单位**，给出一条完整的具体行为链提案；人不答题，人对稿子做「采纳 / 改具体元素」的决策。\n\n**一个功能点提案长这样**(你举的例子，格式化)：\n\n```\n📦 功能点:项目导出\n   用户点「导出」按钮\n     → 页面弹出等待框\n     → 触发后端 export 函数\n     → 函数逻辑:按 创建时间 取近 90 天数据\n```\n\n人的决策动作不是回答“你要导出多久的数据？”,而是看着这条链说：\n\n- **采纳** —— 整条对\n- **改元素** —— “函数名叫 exportOrders”、“90 天改成 30 天”、“判断条件从创建时间改成更新时间”\n\n**为什么这个形态同时打三个断点**：\n\n| 断点 | 怎么解的 |\n|---|---|\n| ① 看不懂 | 没有黑话了——每个决策点都以「链上某个具体值」的形态出现(30天、创建时间、export),人不需要理解维度，只需要看着值判断对不对 |\n| ② 预见不了后果 | 链是端到端的：从「点按钮」一直演到「取哪些数据」——人看到的不只是决策，是决策嵌入的完整效果 |\n| ③ 纠错后置 | 改值发生在提案阶段，成本为零；同样的错误若是实现完才发现，就是返工 |\n\n**关键的范式转变**：人的角色从「答题者」变成「审稿者」。答题需要人凭空生成答案(难，容易不懂装懂)；审稿只需要人对着具体内容挑错(易，看不懂的地方自己就暴露出来了)。这天然吸收了我之前的思路二(AI 先给完整默认，人只否决)——默认值不再是零散的，是嵌在功能链里的。\n\n---\n\n**下一个要你拍板的决策**(一次一个，附推荐)：\n\n**人改的「元素」允许改到哪一层？**\n\n| 选项 | 人可以改的 | 风险 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **A. 只改业务值(推荐)** | 时间范围、判断条件、功能命名、增删功能点 —— 即例子里的“90天/创建时间/export名” | 界限清晰：AI 对业务负责，人只动业务参数 |\n| B. 业务值 + 链的结构 | A 之外，还能改链条本身——“不要等待框，改成后台任务+通知” | 灵活，但链结构往往牵动技术方案，人改结构容易改出不可行的稿 |\n| C. 全开放 | 包括“触发后端函数”这类实现环节也能改 | 边界消失，人被拖进实现细节，回到“人要懂技术”的老路 |\n\n我的推荐是 **A**:链的结构(等待框还是后台任务这类)属于方案范畴，应该由 AI 在提案里给出 2 选 1 的**变体**让人选，而不是让人自由改。你定哪个？"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1792546297243,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":1471,"outputTokens":1393,"totalTokens":25136,"cacheReadTokens":22272}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1792546297243,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"stop"},"replayState":{"response":{"kind":"pi-ai","version":2,"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-coding-cn","model":"glm-5.3","responseId":"202610210931055c2a20fc51c94b00","stopReason":"stop"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text"}]}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}
