少 / 问得准 / 功能点提案-改稿 / 验收终检)→ **结构**(两环节 + 体验变体上浮规则)。\n\n我把这整件事整理成一版完整的总结文档(问题定义 + 解决框架 + 两环节交互形态)，作为后续设计 skill 改造的输入——现在整理，还是你还有思路要继续碰？"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1792546605398,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":621,"outputTokens":1183,"totalTokens":26892,"cacheReadTokens":25088}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1792546605398,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"stop"},"replayState":{"response":{"kind":"pi-ai","version":2,"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-coding-cn","model":"glm-5.3","responseId":"2026102109361962832633dc304357","stopReason":"stop"},"blocks":[{"type":"reasoning","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text"}]}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}
