{"type":"agent/inbox/spliced","seq":144,"time":1792547471740,"data":{"target":"next-step","start":0,"inserted":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nAdditional instructions from: assets/claude-template/CLAUDE.md\n\nThese instructions apply to work under `assets/claude-template`. Use them as guidance when relevant; more specific instructions take precedence. They do not override system, developer, or direct user instructions.\n\n## 项目介绍\n这是一个【项目类型】项目,主要功能包含【核心功能】。\n\n本项目用 cgraphx 的 skill 流程做需求。**流程全图见 `FLOW-MAP.md`**(各流程的链 / 前置依赖 / 强制读 / 产物落点);主线:先用 knowledge-recall 对齐概念,再 clarify 澄清(结束时在对话里给决策表,没看懂可以用 visual-explain 出图解),spec 是唯一契约;小需求直接 implementation,大需求先 write-plan,再 subagent-implement 在一个会话里跑完,最后 /code-review。平行支线:接口测试、单元测试、知识库、规范(guides)。\n\n## 项目约定\n\n- **schema 变更约定(全量+增量双层维护)**:见 `docs/guides/data-standards.md`「Schema 变更约定」节——动表时按其命名与维护规则执行(规范缺失先 `/init-project-guides` 补齐,动表前必读)。\n\n你负责按阶段推进需求,并在每个任务/阶段收尾时**主动给出下一步建议**(2–4 条,标注对应 skill;不要每轮都附,用户已明确就直接执行)。阶段判断:看需求目录 `docs/features/<日期>-<编号>-<前缀>/` 已有产物(有无 spec / plan / 实现)+ 对话上下文。\n\n</system-reminder>"}],"source":{"kind":"agent-instructions","form":"instructions","changes":[{"action":"set","scope":"assets/claude-template\u0000CLAUDE.md","path":"assets/claude-template/CLAUDE.md","digest":"cf7136e079df9778042a9e73dd4d7549818b9661"}]},"role":"user","id":"5ed4f2d1-4fc2-4513-a01e-2a29a57c3a43"}]}}
